---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | wagecheck"
  description="About wagecheck — free, accurate UK salary and tax calculators built for everyday financial clarity."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-white to-lime-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 md:py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-emerald-700">About</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
          About <span class="font-display italic text-emerald-600">Wagecheck</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 sm:text-xl">
          Free, accurate UK salary and tax calculators — built for everyday financial clarity.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 md:py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18v-5.25m0 0a6.01 6.01 0 0 0 1.5-.189m-1.5.189a6.01 6.01 0 0 1-1.5-.189m3.75 7.478a12.06 12.06 0 0 1-4.5 0m3.75 2.383a14.406 14.406 0 0 1-3 0M14.25 18v-.192c0-.983.658-1.823 1.508-2.316a7.5 7.5 0 1 0-7.517 0c.85.493 1.509 1.333 1.509 2.316V18" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
          We built Wagecheck because understanding your take-home pay should not require a degree in accounting. Too many UK workers accept job offers, plan mortgages and budget around rough guesses because accurate take-home pay tools are either paywalled or buried behind sign-ups. We wanted a single place where anyone can enter their salary and instantly see the real number — after income tax, National Insurance, pension and student loan. Every calculator is free, always. We update every April when HMRC publishes new rates, so you never work with outdated figures. Our goal is financial clarity for everyone, regardless of income.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
          All calculations run instantly in your browser — your salary data never leaves your device. We do not collect, store or transmit any personal information. There are no sign-ups, no accounts and no hidden data harvesting. Every rate and threshold comes directly from HMRC, GOV.UK and the relevant devolved authorities. When rates change in April, we update our calculators within the first week of the new tax year. We also listen to community feedback: feature requests, corrections and suggestions directly shape what we build next. The result is a calculator suite that stays accurate, fast and genuinely useful.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 0 0 2.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 0 0 4.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 0 0-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 0 1 8.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0 1 11.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 1 1-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 0 1 6.75 0Zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 1 1-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 0 1 5.25 0Z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Who It's For</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
          Employees checking whether their payslip is correct. Job seekers comparing two offers side by side to see which leaves more in their pocket. Freelancers and self-employed workers working out their tax bill before self-assessment deadline. Employers doing quick headcount calculations for payroll planning. Students and graduates entering the workforce for the first time and trying to understand what their starter salary actually means month-to-month. Landlords assessing rental yield. Anyone in the UK who earns money and wants to know exactly where it goes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Why Trust Wagecheck?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
          Every calculation is aligned to HMRC-published rates and verified against GOV.UK guidance. We review and update all calculators every April when the new tax year begins, and correct any errors as soon as they are identified. Each page includes a change log so you can see exactly when rates were last updated. Wagecheck is used by thousands of people every month for salary planning, job comparisons and self-assessment preparation. The tool is 100% free with no paywalls, no premium tier and no hidden costs — we keep it that way through non-intrusive advertising.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">What We Cover</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
      <a href="/salary-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818.879.659 1.236-2.02c.622-.462 1.29-.76 2.005-.967A6 6 0 1 1 12 6Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Salary &amp; Take-Home Pay</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Full breakdown after tax, NI, pension and student loan</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/hourly-wage-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Hourly Wage</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Convert your hourly rate to annual, monthly and weekly salary</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/pro-rata-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 21 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 21 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 5.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 21 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Pro-Rata Calculator</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Part-time and irregular hours based on full-time equivalent</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/stamp-duty-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 12l8.954-8.955c.44-.439 1.152-.439 1.591 0L21.75 12M4.5 9.75v10.125c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125H9.75v-4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21h4.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.75M8.25 21h8.25" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Stamp Duty (SDLT)</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Property tax for England, Northern Ireland and Scotland</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/bonus-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 11.25v8.25a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H5.25a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5-1.5v-8.25M12 4.875A2.625 2.625 0 1 0 9.375 7.5H12m0-2.625V7.5m0-2.625A2.625 2.625 0 1 1 14.625 7.5H12m0 0V21m-8.625-9.75h18c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125h-18c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Bonus Tax</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">See how much of your bonus you keep after tax and NI</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/pay-rise-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.307a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.519l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Pay Rise</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Compare your current and new salary side-by-side</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/overtime-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Overtime Pay</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Time and a half, double time — gross and net overtime pay</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/mortgage-affordability/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 21h19.5m-18-18v18m10.5-18v18m6-13.5V21M3 3h12m-.75 4.5H21m-3.75 0H21m-3.75 3H21m-3.75 3H21" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Mortgage Affordability</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">How much you can borrow and estimated monthly payments</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/required-salary/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0ZM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 14.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0 1 12 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Required Salary</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Work backwards from your desired take-home pay</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/compare-salaries/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 21L3 16.5m0 0L7.5 12M3 16.5h13.5m0-13.5L21 7.5m0 0L16.5 12M21 7.5H7.5" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Compare Salaries</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Side-by-side comparison of two job offers</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/salary-tables/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.375 19.5h17.25m-17.25 0a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125M3.375 19.5h1.5C5.496 19.5 6 18.996 6 18.375m-2.625 0V5.625m0 12.75v-1.5c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125m18.375 2.625V5.625m0 12.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125m1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125m0 3.75h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 18 18.375M20.625 4.5H3.375m17.25 0c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125M20.625 4.5h-1.5C18.504 4.5 18 5.004 18 5.625m3.75 0v1.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125M3.375 4.5c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125M3.375 4.5h1.5C5.496 4.5 6 5.004 6 5.625m-3.75 0v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125m1.5-3.75C5.496 8.25 6 7.746 6 7.125v-1.5M4.875 8.25C5.496 8.25 6 8.754 6 9.375v1.5m0-5.25v5.25m0-5.25C6 5.004 6.504 4.5 7.125 4.5h9.75c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125m1.125 2.625h1.5m-1.5 0A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 18 7.125v-1.5m1.125 2.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5m2.625-2.625c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125M18 5.625v5.25M7.125 12h9.75m-9.75 0A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 6 10.875M7.125 12C6.504 12 6 12.504 6 13.125m0-2.25C6 11.496 5.496 12 4.875 12M18 10.875c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125M18 10.875c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125m-2.25 0c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125m-12 5.25v-5.25m0 5.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h9.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125m-12 0v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125M18 18.375v-5.25m0 5.25v-1.5c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125M18 13.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125M18 13.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125M6 13.125v1.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125M6 13.125C6 12.504 5.496 12 4.875 12m-1.5 0h1.5m-1.5 0c-.621 0-1.125-.504-1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125m1.5 3.75c-.621 0-1.125-.504-1.125-1.125" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Salary Tables</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Tax bands, thresholds and reference tables</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/national-minimum-wage/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">National Minimum Wage</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Current NMW and NLW rates by age group</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/rental-yield/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 3 19.875v-6.75ZM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V8.625ZM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V4.125Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Rental Yield</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Gross and net yield for buy-to-let properties</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/scottish-salary-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1 1 15 0Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Scottish Salary Calculator</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Calculate take-home pay using Scotland's 6-band income tax system</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/sick-pay-calculator/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-sm">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12Z" /></svg>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Sick Pay Calculator</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Calculate Statutory Sick Pay (SSP) under the new day-1 rules</p>
