          <li><a href="https://www.gov.uk/national-insurance-rates-letters" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 font-semibold">GOV.UK — National Insurance rates</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.gov.uk/stamp-duty-land-tax" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 font-semibold">GOV.UK — Stamp Duty Land Tax</a></li>
